- Useful diffs later: secrets locality; cron/alerts depth; cluster-review export/history; INTRADAY depth; live broker only in Core delivery.
- Gate: defer **delivery** to **autumn–winter 2026**. IP kernel split is already in progress (`docs/BONES_AND_CORE.md`).

